      "text": {
        "hi": "आज की कहानी: ‘Dev and the Dog’ (देव और कुत्ता)। पहले कुछ शब्द सीखते हैं।",
        "hinglish": "Aaj ki kahani: ‘Dev and the Dog’ (Dev aur kutta). Pehle kuch shabd seekhte hain.",
        "en": "Today's story: ‘Dev and the Dog’. First, a few words."
